Fresh 20-seed causal hold-out for clipping geometry. At epoch 180 branch standard 4m+r into ordinary elementwise clipping versus direction-preserving updates whose edge L2 magnitude is matched exactly to the elementwise-clipped update, either per type-pair group or globally. Primary contrast: scale 0.115 group-L2 versus standard clip at epoch 200 for hard margin, with CE, accuracy, soft margin, finite and weight norm corroboration. Secondary scales 0.100 and 0.110 test whether the intervention preserves the stable regime rather than merely damping all learning.